WEBVTT

00:00:00.527 --> 00:00:01.200
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.187 --> 00:00:05.707
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> <b>Eating</b> outside in the summer makes me feel good.

00:00:07.255 --> 00:00:10.559
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> Happiness is <b>getting up</b> late and <b>not going</b> to work.

00:00:12.531 --> 00:00:13.192
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:14.192 --> 00:00:16.701
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> I love <b>having</b> breakfast in bed.

00:00:18.247 --> 00:00:21.070
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> I hate <b>not getting</b> to the airport early.

00:00:23.104 --> 00:00:23.871
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:24.861 --> 00:00:27.007
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> I’m thinking of <b>buying</b> a new car.

00:00:28.529 --> 00:00:30.619
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> Jim left without <b>saying</b> goodbye.